{"id":"dda7c85261e49800","group":"58","path":"58/batch20/58-df-zfc-tree9-front.md","title":"ZFC Tree9 Front","display":"df-zfc-tree9-front — ZFC Tree9 Front","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-tree9-front","aliases":["58-df-zfc-tree9-front"],"display":"df-zfc-tree9-front — ZFC Tree9 Front","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-finite-sequence]]","[[58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order]]","[[58-df-zfc-tree8-antichain-in-tree]]","[[58-df-zfc-tree8-branch-through-tree]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-tree9-front"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-tree9-front</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-tree9-front — ZFC Tree9 Front"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f4bf86f66c1444da\" href=\"?note=f4bf86f66c1444da\" title=\"58-df-finite-sequence\">58-df-finite-sequence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d25b709595952a78\" href=\"?note=d25b709595952a78\" title=\"58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order\">58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"35a06fac3604c479\" href=\"?note=35a06fac3604c479\" title=\"58-df-zfc-tree8-antichain-in-tree\">58-df-zfc-tree8-antichain-in-tree</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"c1e64933d6b4128f\" href=\"?note=c1e64933d6b4128f\" title=\"58-df-zfc-tree8-branch-through-tree\">58-df-zfc-tree8-branch-through-tree</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\omega^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(T\\subseteq\\omega^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span> (tree of finite sequences)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\\subseteq T\">\\(F\\subseteq T\\)</span> (front candidate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\\in[T]\">\\(b\\in[T]\\)</span> (branch through <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t\\in F\">\\(s,t\\in F\\)</span> (front nodes bound in the antichain clause)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u,v\\in\\omega^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(u,v\\in\\omega^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span> (nodes bound in the tree clause)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H,R\\in V\">\\(H,R\\in V\\)</span> (finite-sequence carrier and prefix-order relation)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FinSeq},\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcTree8AntichainInTree}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcTree8BranchThroughTree}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{FinSeq},\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcTree8AntichainInTree}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcTree8BranchThroughTree}_S\\)</span> (sourced predicates)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTree9Front}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTree9Front}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree9\\text{-}front} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTree9Front}_S(F,T)\\leftrightarrow\\exists H,R\\in V\\;\\Bigl[H=\\{u\\in\\mathcal P(\\omega\\times\\omega):\\mathrm{FinSeq}(u,\\omega)\\}\\land T\\subseteq H\\land(\\forall u\\in T\\;\\forall v\\in H\\;(v\\subseteq u\\to v\\in T))\\land R=\\{\\langle s,t\\rangle\\in T\\times T:s\\subseteq t\\}\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S(T,R)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTree8AntichainInTree}_S(F,T,R)\\land\\forall b\\subseteq T\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcTree8BranchThroughTree}_S(b,T,R)\\to\\exists s\\in F\\;(s\\in b)\\bigr)\\Bigr]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree9\\text{-}front} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTree9Front}_S(F,T)\\leftrightarrow\\exists H,R\\in V\\;\\Bigl[H=\\{u\\in\\mathcal P(\\omega\\times\\omega):\\mathrm{FinSeq}(u,\\omega)\\}\\land T\\subseteq H\\land(\\forall u\\in T\\;\\forall v\\in H\\;(v\\subseteq u\\to v\\in T))\\land R=\\{\\langle s,t\\rangle\\in T\\times T:s\\subseteq t\\}\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S(T,R)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTree8AntichainInTree}_S(F,T,R)\\land\\forall b\\subseteq T\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcTree8BranchThroughTree}_S(b,T,R)\\to\\exists s\\in F\\;(s\\in b)\\bigr)\\Bigr]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The branch space notation is replaced by the registered maximal-branch predicate over an explicit prefix-order relation.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-finite-sequence","status":"resolved","id":"f4bf86f66c1444da","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-finite-sequence]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order","status":"resolved","id":"d25b709595952a78","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-tree8-antichain-in-tree","status":"resolved","id":"35a06fac3604c479","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-tree8-antichain-in-tree]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-tree8-branch-through-tree","status":"resolved","id":"c1e64933d6b4128f","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-tree8-branch-through-tree]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T\\subseteq\\omega^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"F\\subseteq T","display":false},{"tex":"b\\in[T]","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"s,t\\in F","display":false},{"tex":"u,v\\in\\omega^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"H,R\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FinSeq},\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcTree8AntichainInTree}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcTree8BranchThroughTree}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTree9Front}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree9\\text{-}front} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTree9Front}_S(F,T)\\leftrightarrow\\exists H,R\\in V\\;\\Bigl[H=\\{u\\in\\mathcal P(\\omega\\times\\omega):\\mathrm{FinSeq}(u,\\omega)\\}\\land T\\subseteq H\\land(\\forall u\\in T\\;\\forall v\\in H\\;(v\\subseteq u\\to v\\in T))\\land R=\\{\\langle s,t\\rangle\\in T\\times T:s\\subseteq t\\}\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S(T,R)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTree8AntichainInTree}_S(F,T,R)\\land\\forall b\\subseteq T\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcTree8BranchThroughTree}_S(b,T,R)\\to\\exists s\\in F\\;(s\\in b)\\bigr)\\Bigr]","display":true}],"bytes":1606,"backlinks":[{"id":"54aed6245d096f1e","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e48b88ef54774547","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTree9Front}_S$ (front predicate, see [[58-df-zfc-tree9-front]])"},{"id":"2a9ed3d666bd4979","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3833","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-zfc-tree9-front.md|58-df-zfc-tree9-front]]（batch20）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","f4bf86f66c1444da","d25b709595952a78","35a06fac3604c479","c1e64933d6b4128f"]}